COPYRIGHT NOTICE AND LIMITED PERSONAL USE TERMS

Project: Wyvern Drive
Description: A self-hostable, Discord-backed personal cloud drive. A Node.js
server (Express + Discord.js + SQLite) manages Discord OAuth2 sign-in and
stores encrypted file chunks as Discord attachments in a bot-managed private
channel, while a responsive React web client provides the Drive interface.
Copyright (c) 2026 Zendevve. All rights reserved.

Source: https://github.com/Zendevve/Wyvern-Drive

